Ok.. You are just goping arouind in circkes forever...  Answer this and only this. Do not consider anything else. Forget everything else you have been doing for the last hours. Why does this rule exist? @container pf-1 (min-width: 1024px)
[data-pathland-id="1"] > [data-pathland-fit-cand] {
display: none !important;
